    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 17 (Abolition of Untouchability) is a frequently asked fundamental right in competitive exams.",
        "Article 110 defines a Money Bill, which can only be introduced in the Lok Sabha.",
        "Emergency Provisions under Article 352 (National), Article 356 (President's Rule), and Article 360 (Financial) are recurring exam topics.",
        "Article 123 grants ordinance-making power to the President during Parliament's recess."
      ],
